The two staircases up would lead to Vlad's Tower, not to the Wizard's
tower.  What you are looking for is to gain entrance to one of the
so-called "fake towers" a level or two above the vibrating square - to
do this you will need some means of crossing the moat and some means of
getting through the walls (usually a wand of digging).  One of the two
will contain a portal which will put you into the real Tower.

